 CNSsolve>! *********************************************************************** 
 CNSsolve>! 
 CNSsolve>{+ file: dna-rna_restraints.def +} 
 CNSsolve>{+ description: Creates restraints to maintain conformation of DNA/RNA +} 
 CNSsolve>{+ Additions and changes were made to allow for flexibility during docking +} 
 CNSsolve>{+ comment:This file is to be read by refinement files that modify atom coordinates +} 
 CNSsolve>{+ authors: Axel T. Brunger, and Paul D. Adams +} 
 CNSsolve>{+ modified by Alexandre Bonvin and Marc van Dijk for HADDOCK use +} 
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{============================================== base planarity =============================================} 
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{* Restrain base planarity. This selection must only include nucleotide residues *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($dna_bases_planar=true) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $DNA_BASES_PLANAR set to TRUE (logical)
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{=================================== sugar-pucker dihedral angle restraints ================================} 
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{* Pick the dihedral angles of the sugar pucker from the input structure 
 CNSsolve>   and restrain them within the given error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($dna_pick_pucdih=true) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $DNA_PICK_PUCDIH set to TRUE (logical)
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{* dihedral C1'-C2'-C3'-C4' error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($error_nu2=0.0) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $ERROR_NU2 set to    0.00000     (real)
 CNSsolve>{* dihedral C5'-C4'-C3'-C2' error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($error_nu3=0.0) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $ERROR_NU3 set to    0.00000     (real)
 CNSsolve>{* dihedral C1'-O4'-C4'-C5' error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($error_nu4=0.0) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $ERROR_NU4 set to    0.00000     (real)
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{================================ phosphate backbone dihedral angle restraints =============================} 
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{* Pick the dihedral angles of the phosphate backbone from the input structure and 
 CNSsolve>   restrain them within the given error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($dna_pick_bacdih=true) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $DNA_PICK_BACDIH set to TRUE (logical)
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{* Error range for phosphate backbone dihedrals *} 
 CNSsolve>{* alpha dihedral O3'-P-O5'-C5' error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($error_alpha=10.0) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $ERROR_ALPHA set to    10.0000     (real)
 CNSsolve>{* beta dihedral P-O5'-C5'-C4' error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($error_beta=40.0) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $ERROR_BETA set to    40.0000     (real)
 CNSsolve>{* gamma dihedral O5'-C5'-C4'-C3' error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($error_gamma=20.0) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $ERROR_GAMMA set to    20.0000     (real)
 CNSsolve>{* delta dihedral C5'-C4'-C3'-O3' error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($error_delta=50.0) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $ERROR_DELTA set to    50.0000     (real)
 CNSsolve>{* epsilon dihedral C4'-C3'-O3'-P error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($error_eps=10.0) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $ERROR_EPS set to    10.0000     (real)
 CNSsolve>{* zeta dihedral C3'-O3'-P-O5' error range *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($error_zeta=50.0) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $ERROR_ZETA set to    50.0000     (real)
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{=========================================== Watson-Crick base pairs =======================================} 
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{* automatically pick Watson-Crick restraint values from structure *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($dna_pick_wc=true) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $DNA_PICK_WC set to TRUE (logical)
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{* error range used for dna_pick_wc defined Watson-Crick restraints *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($wc_low=0.05) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $WC_LOW set to   0.500000E-01 (real)
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($wc_up=0.05) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $WC_UP set to   0.500000E-01 (real)
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>{=========================================== Coarse-Grained ===========================================================} 
 CNSsolve>{* Is the DNA/RNA molecule CG? *} 
 CNSsolve>evaluate ($dna_cg=false) 
 EVALUATE: symbol $DNA_CG set to FALSE (logical)
 CNSsolve> 
